/* Model guide: low disk space when one model would fit; arguments are two sizes */
"Vauta needs about %@ (the download plus room to unpack); this Mac has %@ free. Free up space first, or turn on the “Use one model only” option." = "Vauta 约需 %@（下载加上解压所需空间），这台 Mac 可用 %@。请先释放空间，或开启“只使用一个模型”。";

