/* Answers card: first-run notice shown once, in the panel, before the first answer */
"Vauta now answers questions it hears, from this meeting, your past meetings and your documents. Answers appear only in this panel, which Vauta asks macOS to keep out of screen sharing; that is not guaranteed." = "Vauta 现在会根据本次会议、你过去的会议和你的文档，回答它听到的问题。回答只会出现在此面板中，Vauta 会请求 macOS 不让该面板出现在屏幕共享中，但这并不能保证。";

/* Network Activity: under the summary when a destination is outside the local network */
