/* Status detail */
"Vauta opens when you log in." = "登录时会打开 Vauta。";

/* Alert text when the Mac has no password */
"Vauta protects Meetings and Context with your login password or Touch ID. Without a password, anyone using this Mac can open them. You can set one in System Settings → Users & Groups." = "Vauta 使用你的登录密码或 Touch ID 保护“会议”和“背景⁠信息”。如果没有密码，任何使用这台 Mac 的人都能打开它们。你可以在“系统⁠设置 → 用户与群组”中设置密码。";

/* Settings → Calendar & Reminders: what the brief reads from the calendar; in languages that put a space between the number and “hours”, make it a no-break space; Japanese and Korean write 12時間 and 12시간 with none, like the minutes in the same pane */
"Vauta reads in full only the meeting about to start and the next one within 12 hours: title, time, people and link. To time the notification it looks only at when the events of the next few hours start. It keeps no copy of your calendar, and the brief never writes to Calendar, Reminders or Notes." = "Vauta 只会完整读取即将开始的会议和 12 小时内的下一场会议：标题、时间、参与者和链接。为了确定通知时间，它只会查看接下来几小时内事件的开始时间。它不会保留你的日历副本，会前简报也绝不会写入“日历”“提醒事项”或“备忘录”。";

/* Settings → Calendar & Reminders: what showing reminders in the brief reads */
"Vauta reads only incomplete reminders in the lists you choose: title, due date, list and priority. It keeps no copy, and the brief never changes them." = "Vauta 只会读取你所选列表中未完成的提醒事项：标题、截止日期、列表和优先级。它不会保留副本，会前简报也绝不会更改它们。";

/* Speaker popover: what saving the user’s own voice does */
"Vauta saves a fingerprint of this voice as yours on this Mac only and names this speaker “Me”. Later imported recordings can then suggest which speaker is you." = "Vauta 会把这个声音的声纹作为你的声纹，仅存储在这台 Mac 上，并将这位发言人命名为“我”。之后导入的录音就可以建议哪位发言人是你。";

/* Settings → Recording */
"Vauta shows a suggestion when a meeting app starts using the microphone. It never starts recording on its own." = "当会议 App 开始使用麦克风时，Vauta 会显示建议。它绝不会自行开始录音。";

/* Consent sheet footnote: the time of the confirmation is stored; consent is the recording user’s responsibility; organizations are advised to cover it in a data protection impact assessment */
"Vauta stores the time you confirm this next to the voice. Consent is your responsibility as the person recording. Organizations should note voice recognition in their data protection impact assessment." = "Vauta 会把你确认的时间与声音一起存储。取得同意是录音者的责任。组织机构应在其数据保护影响评估中说明声音识别。";

/* Setup page subtitle when the speech model is installed */
